  <!-- ==================== SECTION 6: FAQ ==================== -->
  <section id="faq-science" class="faq-section section-padding" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header fade-in">
        <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
        <h2 id="faq-heading" class="section-title">Science FAQ</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you wanted to know about nano-hemp technology.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-container">
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          {% if block.type == 'faq_item' %}
            <article class="faq-item fade-in" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
                <span>{{ block.settings.question }}</span>
                <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
              </button>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>{{ block.settings.answer }}</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}

        {% comment %} Fallback: if no blocks configured, render default FAQ {% endcomment %}
        {% if section.blocks == empty or section.blocks.size == 0 %}
          <!-- FAQ 1 -->
          <article class="faq-item fade-in">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <span>How does nano-technology improve absorption?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Nano-technology reduces hemp particle size to under 100 nanometers, allowing them to pass efficiently through biological membranes in the mouth and digestive tract. Traditional hemp particles measure 5,000-10,000nm, too large for efficient absorption. Our nano-hemp achieves 30-80% absorption rates compared to just 6-10% for traditional products, meaning your body actually uses more of what you take.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <!-- FAQ 2 -->
          <article class="faq-item fade-in">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <span>What does "proprietary nano fragmentation" mean?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Proprietary nano fragmentation is our breakthrough technology, developed by Ivy League PhD scientists at a powerful West Coast biotech company, that gently breaks down hemp particles to nano-size. This proprietary process is exclusive to our products and represents a significant advancement in hemp delivery technology, achieving particle sizes under 100nm without compromising compound integrity.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <!-- FAQ 3 -->
          <article class="faq-item fade-in">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <span>Are your products third-party tested?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes, every batch is independently lab tested for potency verification, purity screening, heavy metals, pesticides, and microbial contaminants. We manufacture in a GMP-certified facility and publish Certificates of Analysis (COAs) because we believe families deserve complete transparency about what they're putting in their bodies.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <!-- FAQ 4 -->
          <article class="faq-item fade-in">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <span>Why only four ingredients?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>We believe simplicity equals quality. Most hemp products contain 10+ ingredients with fillers, artificial flavors, and preservatives you can't pronounce. We chose four clean ingredients, Nano-Hemp, Propylene Glycol, Vegetable Glycerin, and Distilled Water, because our nano-fragmentation technology is so effective that nothing else is needed. Every ingredient serves a clear purpose.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <!-- FAQ 5 -->
          <article class="faq-item fade-in">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <span>What is CBN and why is it in the Deep Rest formula?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>CBN (cannabinol) is a hemp-derived compound known for its calming and sleep-supporting properties. Our Deep Rest Evening Formula is our only product that includes CBN Isolate, specifically chosen to support evening relaxation and restful sleep. It's the single exception to our four-ingredient standard, included because it meaningfully enhances the formula's purpose.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <!-- FAQ 6 -->
          <article class="faq-item fade-in">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
              <span>How should I store nano-hemp products?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" /></svg></span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Avoid extreme heat or freezing temperatures. The nano-encapsulation helps maintain stability, but proper storage ensures maximum potency throughout the product's shelf life. Always check the expiration date on your bottle.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<script>
// FAQ Accordion Toggle
window.toggleFaq = function(btn) {
  var item = btn.closest('.faq-item');
  var isOpen = item.classList.contains('active');
  // Close all other items
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item.active').forEach(function(openItem) {
    openItem.classList.remove('active');
    openItem.querySelector('.faq-question').setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  });
  // Toggle current item
  if (!isOpen) {
    item.classList.add('active');
    btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
  }
};
</script>

